{"4824220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meltdown Crew", "steam_appid": 4824220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4857280], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meltdown Crew is an online co-op game where you have to control a 1980s style nuclear reactor by using proximity voice chat and phones to communicate with your friends. You and up to 5 friends have to prevent a total meltdown while producing as much power as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH OUT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All objects are physics based, and fuel rods are fragile, bump into a doorway or a coworker too hard, and you’re both gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/701494d95b52435a6a8f9cde4762b29f.poster.avif?t=1788255044\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/701494d95b52435a6a8f9cde4762b29f.webm?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/701494d95b52435a6a8f9cde4762b29f.mp4?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MONITOR THE SITUATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reactor is under constant change, cooling needs to be adjusted, fuel rods need to be replaced and thrown out, power will cut off and fuses will blow. But keep your cool in the control room and everything will be okay (probably).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/ac49591395e663412242ff32fe82cf46.poster.avif?t=1788255044\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/ac49591395e663412242ff32fe82cf46.webm?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/ac49591395e663412242ff32fe82cf46.mp4?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMUNICATION IS KEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to keep the reactor stable is to work together. If you are in the control room, you can’t take action in time, so grab a phone and connect with your friends running around in the reactor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/4f6904ba5750c4b2f783e24115359817.poster.avif?t=1788255044\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/4f6904ba5750c4b2f783e24115359817.webm?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/4f6904ba5750c4b2f783e24115359817.mp4?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVE AND UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your reactor with improved fuel rods, or new equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/3b86260c8edef9b81377b76947562066.poster.avif?t=1788255044\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/3b86260c8edef9b81377b76947562066.webm?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/3b86260c8edef9b81377b76947562066.mp4?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online co-op up to 6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use landline phones to communicate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Operate a nuclear reactor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drink beers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take showers with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survive chaotic reactor failures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meltdown Crew is an online co-op game where you have to control a 1980s style nuclear reactor by using proximity voice chat and phones to communicate with your friends. You and up to 5 friends have to prevent a total meltdown while producing as much power as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH OUT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All objects are physics based, and fuel rods are fragile, bump into a doorway or a coworker too hard, and you’re both gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/701494d95b52435a6a8f9cde4762b29f.poster.avif?t=1788255044\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/701494d95b52435a6a8f9cde4762b29f.webm?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/701494d95b52435a6a8f9cde4762b29f.mp4?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MONITOR THE SITUATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reactor is under constant change, cooling needs to be adjusted, fuel rods need to be replaced and thrown out, power will cut off and fuses will blow. But keep your cool in the control room and everything will be okay (probably).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/ac49591395e663412242ff32fe82cf46.poster.avif?t=1788255044\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/ac49591395e663412242ff32fe82cf46.webm?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/ac49591395e663412242ff32fe82cf46.mp4?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMUNICATION IS KEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to keep the reactor stable is to work together. If you are in the control room, you can’t take action in time, so grab a phone and connect with your friends running around in the reactor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/4f6904ba5750c4b2f783e24115359817.poster.avif?t=1788255044\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/4f6904ba5750c4b2f783e24115359817.webm?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/4f6904ba5750c4b2f783e24115359817.mp4?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVE AND UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your reactor with improved fuel rods, or new equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/3b86260c8edef9b81377b76947562066.poster.avif?t=1788255044\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/3b86260c8edef9b81377b76947562066.webm?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/extras/3b86260c8edef9b81377b76947562066.mp4?t=1788255044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online co-op up to 6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use landline phones to communicate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Operate a nuclear reactor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drink beers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take showers with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survive chaotic reactor failures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Run a barely-stable nuclear reactor with your friends in this online co-op physics chaos game. Fix broken systems, manage radiation, survive power outages, and prevent a total meltdown before everything goes horribly wrong.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/af47b508b6f44daee052b0c2e49f859e32171c13/header.jpg?t=1788255044", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824220/83ba4d0311e235c2af488f53d056d01dc913f33a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788255044", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai